1
00:00:00,105 --> 00:00:04,729
Detached heads must be placed in the parts tray, not thrown.

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:11,035
Several units struck by falling heads have dropped off their support platforms this week.

3
00:00:11,816 --> 00:00:17,061
Send damaged casings for inspection rather than returning them to the packing area.

4
00:00:17,541 --> 00:00:21,264
The resulting losses will be charged to the responsible shift.
